---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---

<section class="box skills">
	<div class="stack gap-2 lg:gap-4">
		<Icon icon="strategy" color="var(--accent-regular)" size="2.5rem" gradient />
		<h2>Problem Shape Recognition</h2>
		<p>Sensing which business problems are genuinely suited to AI solutions — and which aren't. Before you can build the right thing, someone has to ask the right question.</p>
	</div>
	<div class="stack gap-2 lg:gap-4">
		<Icon icon="microphone-stage" color="var(--accent-regular)" size="2.5rem" gradient />
		<h2>Full-Register Fluency</h2>
		<p>Equally comfortable in the strategic big picture with non-technical stakeholders and in the technical weeds with engineers — moving between those registers in the same conversation.</p>
	</div>
	<div class="stack gap-2 lg:gap-4">
		<Icon icon="rocket-launch" color="var(--accent-regular)" size="2.5rem" gradient />
		<h2>Domain-Grounded AI Literacy</h2>
		<p>Ten years in data analytics, now applied to LLMs and agentic systems. Genuine, firsthand familiarity with how these systems work, where they fail, and how to direct them toward problems worth solving.</p>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.box {
		border: 1px solid var(--gray-800);
		border-radius: 0.75rem;
		padding: 1.5rem;
		background-color: var(--gray-999_40);
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
	}

	.skills {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 3rem;
	}

	.skills h2 {
		font-size: var(--text-lg);
	}

	.skills p {
		color: var(--gray-400);
	}

	@media (min-width: 50em) {
		.box {
			border-radius: 1.5rem;
			padding: 2.5rem;
		}

		.skills {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
			gap: 5rem;
		}

		.skills h2 {
			font-size: var(--text-2xl);
		}
	}
</style>
